{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026iU9XWofFY91794298709.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>富衛集團一份人壽保單，保額打破全球最高紀錄。</p><p></p><p>集團透露，早前成功簽發一份保額逾3.1億美元，相當於約24.8億港元人壽保單，創全球最高價值人壽保單紀錄，較宏利新加坡於今年2月，簽發3億美元保單更高。</p><p></p><p>發言人指，保單是集團重要里程碑，有助鞏固富衛在高資產淨值市場領先地位。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T13:00:47.641681+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":135,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T08:16:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T02:24:03.909424+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:54:14.930122+00:00","content_hash":"a55fd22092eb5611560549820b3587d0fc715bfdbc0c09eb1417e333aa0ae052","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-10T13:00:47.641681+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}